    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d645">

                <pb facs="0678" n="628" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg628"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-01-05"><hi rendition="#italic">January 5,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram of 4th opportune. Friendly disposition manifested by Spanish
                    Government appreciated.</p>
                <p>So long as Spain accords most-favored-nation treatment to American products
                    President will refrain from exercising power of discrimination or exclusion
                    against Spanish products. Read this to minister for foreign affairs.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
